r the events of avengers in-game  and if you consider the fact that crow  has lived throughout that  entire time and we're probably going to  be following him and his story  it makes sense that we'll see atlantis  and possibly namor or his father  in the eternals as we discover crow's  origin i should also add that we could  be seeing some pretty big godzilla type  monsters in the eternals as well  in the comics there's something called  monster island which holds  deviant mutates these are huge giant  creatures  that crow at one point in time sets free  he releases tricephalous  giganto and gigantis from the island  that is near japan  so i think as far as a villain goes for  the eternals they picked a really good  one  one that is incredibly powerful and  rules over the deviants and one who has  a connection with one of the strongest  eternals  and hopefully there's a little bit more  of a secret to the story of who their  kid  or kids may be but let me know what you  think about this villain choice for the  eternals and who do you think  is going to be the child of athena and  crow in the mcu  let me know all your thoughts in the  comments down below don't forget to like  the video and subscribe so you don't  miss out on any of the marvel videos for  lab updates you can follow me on twitter  and  instagram and as always thank you all so  much for watching woof

